on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  2] pusharglist 1 ........................... <1>
  [  4] extcall 50 .............................. <soundBusy(1)>
  [  6] not ..................................... <not soundBusy(1)>
  [  7] jmpifz [ 14] ............................ if not soundBusy(1) then
  [ 10] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 12] extcall 48 .............................. play done
  [ 14] ret
end
